1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,300
Seenaan Dabarfame. Ganda Itoophiyaa
tasgabbaa'aa tokko keessatti,

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,600
jaarsi tokko seenaawwan hedduu onnee
isaa keessatti baatee jira ture.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:17,600
Galgala tokko, yeroo biiftuun lixxu,
mucaan gaaffii isa gaafate.

4
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:23,600
Akaakayyuu, maaliif yeroo hunda seenaa
durii sana nuuf himta?

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:30,600
Jaarsichis seeqee, seenaa waa'ee ganda
isaanii himuu jalqabe.

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:34,600
Waggoota dura, hongee hamaan
lafarratti dhufee,

7
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,600
namoonnis yaaddawuu jalqaban.

8
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:42,350
Haa ta'u malee,

9
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:46,100
mucaan tokko nyaata xiqquma qabu ollaa
rakkate tokkoof qoode.

10
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:50,100
Ollaan sunis deebisee,

11
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:54,100
sanyiin facaafamuuf olkaa'ame tokkicha
mucichaaf kenne.

12
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:57,600
Gandi sunis wal ta'anii sanyicha
dhaabanii,

13
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:01,100
bishaan obaasuun akka inni guddatu
taasisan.

14
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:05,100
Yaa mucaakoo, kan dhimma qabu yoom
akka ta'e utuu hin taane,

15
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:09,100
maal akka nu barsiisudha.

16
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:13,100
Akkasumas barnootichi itti fufe:
seenaan yoo dabarfame,

17
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:17,100
dhalootatu gara fuulduraatti isa
baata.

